{"ai_route":{"actual_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","ai_run_id":"airun_20261003050734_8fee9b05","expected_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","fallback_chain_id":"aifb_80744d5b153ff49a4fcbe5b1","fallback_depth":0,"fallback_reason":"","model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","provider":"mtplx","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","route_base_url":"http://127.0.0.1:8002/v1","route_identity_hash":"c9480819205db8521fec70763515cf905334434da194fa8ae2172b40ab545075","route_profile_id":"independent_ai__mtplx_qwen38_local","thinking":"enabled"},"ai_run_id":"airun_20261003050734_8fee9b05","chunk_index":1,"job_id":"mwjob_f11b0c8e6a5369e3b3df8f61","precondition_digest":"74bc4d137995a3fbc08798d185a3087639dacc8b6f5d24c66b6f3176731163ab","project_id":"proj_user_415ce4db48b2","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v10","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_bf60840c76bbf20b","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_ad88b06c865b2ca0","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_9cf1ca3ac4fac793","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_2a425e10958e903f"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261003050734_8fee9b05","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照的II期概念验证与剂量探索研究：SGC-R21设低/中/高三个剂量组与安慰剂组平行对照，主要评价12周NT-proBNP较基线变化与安全性及耐受性。","quote_sha256":"542b01515fd9e237bf690a2150d8fdba396035e8f67be301275ac5454e1ee339","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es1"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"成人慢性心力衰竭（射血分数降低，LVEF≤40%、NYHA II–III级）患者，已接受标准指南导向药物治疗（GDMT）稳定治疗仍保留中重度症状者。","quote_sha256":"295463a3a18958445d2c19e2577e3c44e3a43cbd39fad8536e218cfa52f977df","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es2"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"SGC-R21片 2.5mg/5mg/10mg（剂量组按随机分配），口服每日一次×12周","quote_sha256":"5933c1a1045fa23c88cefc18589225bcc8b623a8108095fe8a368080a94130a7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es3"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"主要终点：第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化（中心实验室定量）。","quote_sha256":"cf93d08c04b1ed185004699e412fd4e8e81365a7a5b69ad855a2d977c17a8461","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es4"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"每组约40例（共160例）可在双侧α=0.10下提供约80%把握检测组间差异；含约10%脱落补偿。","quote_sha256":"05ddb65548fe3856393aa5e93d253c6d82c45cd18bab3e99792c6329c28de402","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es5"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es1","es2","es3","es4","es5"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[],"heading":"方案概要","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为一项多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照的II期概念验证与剂量探索临床研究，旨在评价口服可溶性鸟苷酸环化酶（sGC）激动剂SMOKE-r2-1（SGC-R21）在成人慢性心力衰竭（射血分数降低，HFrEF）患者中的疗效、安全性及耐受性。研究人群为年龄18至75岁、筛选时左室射血分数≤40%、NYHA心功能分级II至III级、已接受稳定剂量指南导向药物治疗（GDMT，含ACEI/ARB/ARNI、β受体阻滞剂，有指征者MRA）至少4周仍保留中重度症状的成人受试者。受试者按1:1:1:1比例随机分配至SGC-R21低剂量组（2.5 mg）、中剂量组（5 mg）、高剂量组（10 mg）或安慰剂对照组，各组均口服每日一次，连续给药12周；背景GDMT按指南维持稳定。主要疗效终点为第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化（中心实验室定量）。安全性评价包括不良事件与严重不良事件发生率（至末次给药后28天）、生命体征、12导联心电图及临床实验室检查异常发生率、症状性低血压发生率。研究共设筛选期（-28至-1天）、治疗期（第1天至第12周）和安全性随访期（末次给药后28天），计划访视包括筛选、基线随机、第2/4/8/12周门诊访视、治疗结束访视及末次给药后28天安全性随访。样本量按NT-proBNP对数尺度组间标准差约0.35估计，每组约40例、共160例（含约10%脱落补偿），可在双侧α=0.10下提供约80%把握度检测组间差异。主要分析集为全分析集（FAS），主要终点采用ANCOVA（基线log NT-proBNP为协变量）比较各剂量组与安慰剂组第12周变化，报告几何均值比与90%置信区间；安全性按安全性分析集（SAS）描述；本研究无确证性假设检验。","rationale":"本章正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的总体研究设计、目标人群、干预方案、主要终点、安全性终点、研究时期、访视策略、样本量策略及统计分析策略撰写。剂量递增与安全性暂停规则的具体条款需医学经理在方案正文中另行确认。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（方案概要）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（α、主要终点、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_bf60840c76bbf20b","section_number":"1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:c49661c22ebb276bcf6cc0a3","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261003050734_8fee9b05","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取HFrEF中国及全球流行病学数据、疾病负担文献或指南引用","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_1_epidemiology","missing_source_classes":["流行病学数据","疾病负担文献"],"target":"疾病背景及治疗现状-流行病学与疾病负担段落"},{"action":"获取现行HFrEF诊疗指南及标准治疗方案描述","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_1_guideline","missing_source_classes":["诊疗指南","治疗现状文献"],"target":"疾病背景及治疗现状-治疗现状段落"}],"heading":"疾病背景及治疗现状","missing_source_classes":["HFrEF流行病学与疾病负担数据","HFrEF诊疗指南（中国/国际）","HFrEF当前标准治疗现状与未满足需求"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要HFrEF的流行病学数据（患病率、发病率、疾病负担）、当前标准治疗指南（如中国心衰指南、ESC/AHA指南）及现有治疗手段的疗效与局限性描述。当前允许来源中无上述内容；公司语料来源均为其他适应症（PNH、炎症性皮肤病、特应性皮炎），按跨适应症规则不得迁移疾病特异内容。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_ad88b06c865b2ca0","section_number":"2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:c49661c22ebb276bcf6cc0a3","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_c